      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of localized tracheobronchial primary amyloidosis masquerading as \"bronchial asthma\" is presented. Computed tomography of the chest and fiberoptic bronchoscopy image are included. Tracheobronchial primary amyloidosis is a rare, but potentially curable cause of airway obstruction mimicking asthma."},
